  "description": "Catch AutoMapper configuration errors at compile-time before they cause runtime chaos! This Roslyn analyzer detects type mismatches, nullable issues, missing properties, collection incompatibilities, and complex mapping problems - all with intelligent code fixes. Transform AutoMapper development from reactive debugging to proactive prevention. Features 23 analyzer rules with smart fixes for type safety, data integrity, complex mappings, performance, and configuration. Compatible with .NET Framework 4.8+, .NET 6.0+, 8.0+, 9.0+, 10.0+.",
